From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Jefe Lindstaedt <robert.lindstaedt@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove upstream's workflows, Dependabot and Renovate from the
 built tree

Upstream's release workflows publish to Maven Central, CocoaPods and
GitHub Releases; none of them may run in this fork. The fork's own
workflows live on main.
